data: {"type": "TEXT_MESSAGE_CONTENT", "timestamp": 1793260605065, "messageId": "b9c0d1e288", "delta": "A1's 2.5 km doublet brings brine up at 86 °C, hot enough to heat the 70/40 °C network directly, so most of its "}

